{"id":"vod_bf_21045","vodId":"21045","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠·改","name_cn":"龙珠·改","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-22/fe2ee6c94b63c58e08c0f3831b34f863.jpg"},"summary":"许多年前降临在贝吉塔行星上的灾难，无形中改变了整个宇宙的命运。经过最为艰苦的修炼和战斗，孙悟空（野泽雅子 配音）终于赢得天下第一比武大会冠军，和朋友和家人们过上幸福的生活。但是他的战斗并未中止，邪恶无情的手足同胞拉蒂兹、贝吉塔（堀川りょう 配音）、那霸先后造访，之后与曾一手毁灭贝吉塔行星的宇宙最大恶魔弗利萨（中尾隆圣 配音）的宿命决战，再到后来人造人危机以及拥有所有Z战士绝招和不死之身的怪物沙鲁（若本规夫 配音）。宇宙最强战争不断升级，孙悟空和他的朋友们为了全宇宙的和平勇猛冲锋。久违的《龙珠》故事，焕发耀眼夺目的光彩……　　本片根据著名漫画家鸟山明的同名经典原作改编，是动画版开播20周年的纪念作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动作,动画,奇幻,冒险,喜,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 07:13:57","classic":true,"classicRank":41,"franchise":"龙珠","playable":true,"episodeCount":98,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/longzhugai/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/lo